read_restart therm.restart

pair_style tersoff/zbl
pair_coeff * * SiC.tersoff.zbl Si C

reset_timestep 0
compute peatom all pe/atom
compute keatom all ke/atom
compute voronoi all voronoi/atom occupation
fix dynamic_timestep all dt/reset 1 1e-07 0.002 0.05 emax 100
fix NVE all nve
fix com all momentum 100 linear 1 1 1 angular rescale

group proj id 1
group host id != 1
velocity proj set 400.0 400.0 400.0 units box

thermo_style custom step dt time temp press ke pe etotal econserve
thermo 50
dump quickdump all custom 100 trj.lammpstrj id type x y z
dump_modify quickdump sort id
dump_modify quickdump pad 6

run 2000
